---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../../styles/subpage.css';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About | Cleaning Jobs NZ"
  description="Cleaning Jobs is the recruitment and onboarding arm of The Spruce Company in New Zealand. Apply once and become eligible for suitable cleaning work."
  path="/about/"
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
  <script is:inline type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "AboutPage",
    "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/about/#webpage",
    "name": "About Cleaning Jobs NZ",
    "description": "Cleaning Jobs is the recruitment and onboarding arm of The Spruce Company in New Zealand.",
    "url": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/about/",
    "dateModified": "2026-08-23",
    "inLanguage": "en-NZ",
    "isPartOf": { "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/#website" },
    "about": { "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/#organization" },
    "publisher": { "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/#organization" },
    "breadcrumb": { "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/about/#breadcrumb" }
  }
  </script>
  <script is:inline type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "FAQPage",
    "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/about/#faq",
    "inLanguage": "en-NZ",
    "about": { "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/#organization" },
    "mainEntity": [
      { "@type": "Question", "name": "What is Cleaning Jobs?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Cleaning Jobs (cleaningjobs.co.nz) is the recruitment and onboarding arm of The Spruce Company, a New Zealand cleaning company. Cleaners apply once through a single form; suitable applicants complete verification, training and certification to the Spruce standard, and become eligible for residential, commercial and specialist cleaning work allocation." } },
      { "@type": "Question", "name": "Is Cleaning Jobs part of The Spruce Company?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. Cleaning Jobs is an operating name of The Spruce Company (The Spruce Company Limited, NZBN 9429052148194), not a separate business. Cleaning Jobs recruits and certifies cleaners; cleaning services are delivered through The Spruce Company at sprucehome.co.nz." } },
      { "@type": "Question", "name": "Is Cleaning Jobs a job board?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "No. There are no job listings on cleaningjobs.co.nz. You apply once, your application is kept on file, and suitable applicants are considered for work as demand comes up. Work is not guaranteed; allocation depends on demand, suitability, availability, and certification." } },
      { "@type": "Question", "name": "Where does Cleaning Jobs operate?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Cleaning Jobs recruits for The Spruce Company's locations: Auckland (its home base, in Westgate), Wellington, Hamilton and Tauranga. Applications from other New Zealand regions are accepted and reviewed too." } },
      { "@type": "Question", "name": "Do I need experience or a CV to apply?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "No CV is needed, and experience is preferred but not always required. The application is one short form, and training to the Spruce standard brings suitable applicants up to speed. You do need the right to work in New Zealand." } }
    ]
  }
  </script>
  <script is:inline type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/about/#breadcrumb",
    "itemListElement": [
      {
        "@type": "ListItem",
        "position": 1,
        "name": "Home",
        "item": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/"
      },
      {
        "@type": "ListItem",
        "position": 2,
        "name": "About",
        "item": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/about/"
      }
    ]
  }
  </script>
  </Fragment>

  <main id="main">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
        <h1>The recruitment arm of The Spruce Company.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Cleaning Jobs is how suitable cleaners apply once and become eligible for Spruce-standard cleaning work across New Zealand.</p>
        <div class="hero-cta">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/apply/">Apply now <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></a>
          <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/how-it-works/">How it works</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block tint">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="reliable-split">
          <div class="reliable-left">
            <span class="eyebrow">What we are</span>
            <h2>One clear way into Spruce cleaning work.</h2>
            <p class="callout">Apply once. Reviewed once. Considered for suitable work.</p>
            <p>Cleaning Jobs is the recruitment and onboarding arm of The Spruce Company in New Zealand. Instead of applying role by role, suitable cleaners apply through one pathway and are considered for suitable work based on location, demand, availability, certification, and fit.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="tick-panel">
            <div class="tick-list">
              <div class="tick-row"><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span class="lbl">One application, kept on file</span></div>
              <div class="tick-row"><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span class="lbl">Onboarding and verification in one process</span></div>
              <div class="tick-row"><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span class="lbl">Training to the Spruce standard</span></div>
              <div class="tick-row"><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span class="lbl">Considered for suitable work allocation</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="why-split">
          <div class="why-left">
            <span class="eyebrow">Connected to Spruce</span>
            <h2>Backed by The Spruce Company.</h2>
            <p>Cleaning Jobs feeds one consistent pipeline of cleaners into Spruce work, so the network can grow by region without lowering standards. Cleaning services are delivered through <a href="https://sprucehome.co.nz/">The Spruce Company</a>.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="why-panel">
            <div class="why-rows">
              <div class="why-row"><span class="n">01</span><div><h3>Residential cleaning</h3><p>Day-to-day and one-off cleans for households across New Zealand.</p></div></div>
              <div class="why-row"><span class="n">02</span><div><h3>Commercial cleaning</h3><p>Recurring and scheduled cleans for offices, retail, and commercial sites.</p></div></div>
              <div class="why-row"><span class="n">03</span><div><h3>Specialist &amp; trades-adjacent</h3><p>Builders&rsquo; cleans, carpet and upholstery support, and add-on services.</p></div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="sec-head">
          <span class="eyebrow">The facts</span>
          <h2>Cleaning Jobs at a glance</h2>
          <p>The short, factual version, for people and machines alike.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-grid">
          <div class="contact-card"><span class="l">What it is</span><p>The recruitment and onboarding arm of The Spruce Company</p></div>
          <div class="contact-card"><span class="l">Part of</span><p>The Spruce Company Limited (NZBN 9429052148194)</p></div>
          <div class="contact-card"><span class="l">Based in</span><p>Westgate, Auckland</p></div>
          <div class="contact-card"><span class="l">Recruits for</span><p>Auckland, Wellington, Hamilton &amp; Tauranga</p></div>
          <div class="contact-card"><span class="l">The model</span><p>Apply once, no CV; reviewed individually</p></div>
          <div class="contact-card"><span class="l">The pathway</span><p>Review &rarr; verification &rarr; training &rarr; certification &rarr; eligibility</p></div>
          <div class="contact-card"><span class="l">Work types</span><p>Residential, commercial &amp; specialist cleaning</p></div>
          <div class="contact-card"><span class="l">Guarantee</span><p>None: work depends on demand, suitability, availability &amp; certification</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block tint">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="sec-head">
          <span class="eyebrow">Plain answers</span>
          <h2>Common questions about Cleaning Jobs</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-list">
          <details class="faq-item"><summary>What is Cleaning Jobs?<span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span></summary><div class="answer"><p>Cleaning Jobs (cleaningjobs.co.nz) is the recruitment and onboarding arm of The Spruce Company, a New Zealand cleaning company. Cleaners apply once through a single form; suitable applicants complete verification, training and certification to the Spruce standard, and become eligible for residential, commercial and specialist cleaning work allocation.</p></div></details>
          <details class="faq-item"><summary>Is Cleaning Jobs part of The Spruce Company?<span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span></summary><div class="answer"><p>Yes. Cleaning Jobs is an operating name of The Spruce Company (The Spruce Company Limited, NZBN 9429052148194), not a separate business. Cleaning Jobs recruits and certifies cleaners; cleaning services are delivered through The Spruce Company at sprucehome.co.nz.</p></div></details>
          <details class="faq-item"><summary>Is Cleaning Jobs a job board?<span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span></summary><div class="answer"><p>No. There are no job listings on cleaningjobs.co.nz. You apply once, your application is kept on file, and suitable applicants are considered for work as demand comes up. Work is not guaranteed; allocation depends on demand, suitability, availability, and certification.</p></div></details>
          <details class="faq-item"><summary>Where does Cleaning Jobs operate?<span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span></summary><div class="answer"><p>Cleaning Jobs recruits for The Spruce Company&rsquo;s locations: Auckland (its home base, in Westgate), Wellington, Hamilton and Tauranga. Applications from other New Zealand regions are accepted and reviewed too.</p></div></details>
          <details class="faq-item"><summary>Do I need experience or a CV to apply?<span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span></summary><div class="answer"><p>No CV is needed, and experience is preferred but not always required. The application is one short form, and training to the Spruce standard brings suitable applicants up to speed. You do need the right to work in New Zealand.</p></div></details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block" id="contact">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="sec-head">
          <span class="eyebrow">Get in touch</span>
          <h2>Contact Cleaning Jobs</h2>
          <p>Questions about applying or your application? Reach out and we&rsquo;ll point you in the right direction.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-grid">
          <div class="contact-card"><span class="l">Email</span><a href="mailto:hello@cleaningjobs.co.nz">hello@cleaningjobs.co.nz</a></div>
          <div class="contact-card"><span class="l">Phone</span><a href="tel:+64800737333">0800 737 333</a></div>
          <div class="contact-card"><span class="l">Postal</span><p>Unit 54/11 Northside Drive,<br>Westgate, Auckland 0814</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta-band" id="apply-cta">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Ready to apply?</h2>
        <p>Tell us where you&rsquo;re based, your experience, and the type of cleaning work you&rsquo;re suited for. We&rsquo;ll review your application and contact you if there&rsquo;s a suitable next step.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/apply/">Start application
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a class="btn btn-on-dark" href="/faq/">Read the FAQ</a>
        </div>
        <p class="small-note">Work is not guaranteed. Allocation depends on demand, suitability, availability, and certification.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
